# {{id}}

A cox plugin scaffolded by `cox plugin new {{id}} --lang rust`. `docs/design/plugins.md`
(PL) and `docs/plugins.md` in the [cox repository](https://github.com/listepo/cox)
have the full contract; this file only covers this package.

Capabilities asked for at scaffold time: {{with_summary}}. Edit `plugin.toml`'s
`[capabilities]` to change them, and `src/lib.rs` for the exports that back them.

## Build

```
rustup target add wasm32-unknown-unknown   # once
just build
```

## Try it

```
just smoke
```

builds the module, stages it next to `plugin.toml` in `target/`, and runs
`tests/smoke.rs`, which installs the package into a scratch `COX_HOME` with
`cox plugin install --yes` and checks that `cox plugin list --json` reports
it `loaded`. `cox` must be on `PATH`.

## Install for real

```
cox plugin install . --yes
```
